 "shots": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.0,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "text": "I'm testing internet recipes to see if"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 2.0,
   "e": 5.14,
   "dur": 3.14,
   "text": "they're actually good. I don't know about you, but I have hundreds of recipes saved. This"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 5.14,
   "e": 10.71,
   "dur": 5.57,
   "text": "is a result of doom scrolling for hours on it. And then convincing myself, I'll definitely try these later. But to no one's surprise,"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 10.71,
   "e": 13.18,
   "dur": 2.47,
   "text": "later never comes. So I figured it's time to actually"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 13.18,
   "e": 26.36,
   "dur": 13.18,
   "text": "stop being a lazy fuck and give these a shot. These chocolate chip cookies come from a user named Audrey Saurus. They're some of the most aesthetic chocolate chip cookies I've ever seen. They have like pools of melted chocolate running throughout the cookie. A little disappointed, there's not a red velvet version of this cookie."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 26.36,
   "e": 27.96,
   "dur": 1.6,
   "text": "Believe that up to me. These were super"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 27.96,
   "e": 30.16,
   "dur": 2.2,
   "text": "easy to make and they did not disappoint. Biting into"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 30.16,
   "e": 33.53,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "text": "a glob of chocolate is actually all. 10 out of 10 would make again."
  }
